  "description": "Comic Funky is a bold and playful display font inspired by comic books and fun cartoon lettering. With its chunky shapes, rounded edges, and cheerful personality, this font is perfect for kids projects, comic designs, posters, branding, packaging, and social media graphics.\nIts funky and energetic style makes every design stand out while keeping a friendly and approachable feel. Comic Funky works great for headlines, logos, stickers, t-shirts, book covers, classroom materials, birthday invitations, and more.\nAdd a splash of fun and creativity to your projects with Comic Funky!",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Comic Funky is a bold and playful display font inspired by comic books and fun cartoon lettering. With its chunky shapes, rounded edges, and cheerful personality, this font is perfect for kids projects, comic designs, posters, branding, packaging, and social media graphics.</p>\n<p>Its funky and energetic style makes every design stand out while keeping a friendly and approachable feel. Comic Funky works great for headlines, logos, stickers, t-shirts, book covers, classroom materials, birthday invitations, and more.</p>\n<p>Add a splash of fun and creativity to your projects with Comic Funky!</p>",
